089 kv-index-token-blocks: block-parallel KV index gather for every pack_read_stream caller

create_flashinfer_kv_indices_triton already tiles a request's gather over token blocks, but only
the EAGLE call sites ask for it; DFlash verify / draft and the triton backend's decode stream still
launch one program per request that walks the whole prefix. SGLANG_KV_INDEX_TOKEN_BLOCKS=1 sizes
those launches with spec_kv_index_token_blocks as well (servers below 32K context keep the old grid).
flint DFlash2 at 241K, served trace, two interleaved boots per arm: the gather 0.327 -> 0.018 ms per
cycle (4 launches), cycle 14.16 -> 13.87 ms; at 34K 0.055 -> 0.009 ms, cycle flat.
The emitted indices are identical (any block count is correct).
